# Lab 4 access scenarios, SecureLab baseline 2-A.
# Run top to bottom with a client that keeps cookies (alice first, then morgan).
# The password is NOT stored in Git: set @password locally, never commit it.
@host = http://localhost:5080
@password = SET_LOCALLY_DO_NOT_COMMIT

### A-01 anonymous: protected details -> 401, not an HTML redirect
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Login alice (Reporter)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice", "password": "{{password}}" }

### A-02 alice reads own incident -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### A-03 alice reads Bob incident -> 403, no Bob data
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### A-04 alice updates Bob incident -> 403, state unchanged
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "hijacked", "description": "should be denied", "severity": "Low", "occurredAtUtc": "2026-08-02T14:10:00Z" }

### A-04 alice deletes Bob incident -> 403, still exists
DELETE {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### A-05 alice list -> only her incidents (001, 003, 005)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents

### A-06 alice (Reporter) triage -> 403 and audit event authorization.denied
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/triage

### A-11 alice search -> no Bob incident 004
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/search?q=Brien

### A-11 alice severity-summary -> only her counts
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary

### A-12 alice reads comment under Bob incident -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### A-12 alice reads internal comment on own incident -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Logout alice
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

### Login morgan (Analyst)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "morgan", "password": "{{password}}" }

### A-03R morgan reads Alice incident -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### A-12 morgan reads internal comment -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003